routing; it is not applied by the installer and is not an upstream release.
The optional Windows-to-WSL image patch also derives from Herdr 0.9.3.
The optional fx lifecycle patch derives from vercel-labs/fx v0.0.13,
commit 4d966e272cfc4296cdf703f409480088cf2e72ba, under Apache-2.0.
These modified-source patches are independent local fixes, not vendor releases.
Harness names and their text-mode marks identify their respective products and
do not imply endorsement. No terminal executable or vendor dependency is bundled.
